    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6341" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">calvesco</span></b> , ĕre, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. inch. n.</i>
			[calveo], <i>to become bald</i> (post-Aug.), <i><span class="en">Col. 6, 14,
				7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Veg. 3, 4, 27</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 10,
				29, 41, § 78</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b> to plants, <i>to grow
				up thin</i> or <i>far apart</i>, <i><span class="en">Col. 4, 33,
				3</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
